                                "model_answer": "1. Implicit Diff: Differentiate both sides w.r.t $x$.\n2. LHS: $3x^2 + 3y^2 y'$.\n3. RHS: Product rule on $6xy \\Rightarrow 6(1 \\cdot y + x \\cdot y')$.\n4. Equate: $3x^2 + 3y^2 y' = 6y + 6xy'$.\n5. Group $y'$: $3y^2 y' - 6xy' = 6y - 3x^2$.\n6. Solve: $y'(3y^2 - 6x) = 6y - 3x^2 \\Rightarrow y' = \\frac{2y - x^2}{y^2 - 2x}$."
