                                "id": 8,
                                "type": "text",
                                "prompt": "### Predict the Output (Code Tracing)\nPredict the output of each of the following Java code snippets:\n\n1.\n```java\nint x = 5, y = 3;\nSystem.out.println(x > y && y > 0);\n```\n\n2.\n```java\nboolean a = true, b = false;\nSystem.out.println(a || b && !a);\n```\n\n3.\n```java\nint num = 7;\nif (num % 2 == 0)\n    System.out.println(\"Even\");\nelse\n    System.out.println(\"Odd\");\n```\n\n4.\n```java\nint grade = 85;\nif (grade >= 90)\n    System.out.println(\"Excellent\");\nelse if (grade >= 80)\n    System.out.println(\"Very Good\");\nelse\n    System.out.println(\"Other\");\n```\n\n5.\n```java\nint x = 10;\nif (x >= 0 & x <= 100)\n    System.out.println(\"Valid\");\nelse\n    System.out.println(\"Invalid\");\n```",
                                "question": "Predict the Output (Code Tracing)",
                                "model_answer": "**Outputs:**\n\n1. `true` (5 > 3 is true AND 3 > 0 is true)\n2. `true` (!a is false, b && false is false, a || false is true due to operator precedence)\n3. `Odd` (7 % 2 is 1 != 0)\n4. `Very Good` (85 >= 80 is true)\n5. `Valid` (10 is between 0 and 100)",
