                                "model_answer": "**Answers & Analysis:**\n\n- **14**: Valid `int`\n- **15.0**: Valid `double`\n- *****: Invalid (Not enclosed in single or double quotes)\n- **$**: Invalid (Not enclosed in quotes)\n- **-999**: Valid `int`\n- **0.123**: Valid `double`\n- **'R'**: Valid `char`\n- **\"R\"**: Valid `String`\n- **'True'**: Invalid (Single quotes can only contain a single character, not multiple)\n- **32e-4**: Valid `double` (Scientific notation = $32 \\times 10^{-4} = 0.0032$)\n- **'-5'**: Invalid (Contains two characters: `-` and `5` in single quotes)\n- **0.0**: Valid `double`",
