                                "model_answer": "```java\npublic int [] mergeArrays ( int [] arr1 , int [] arr2 ) {\n// The new array 's length is the sum of both arrays '\nlengths\nint [] merged = new int [ arr1 . length + arr2 . length ];\nint index = 0; // Tracks the position in the new 'merged '\narray\n// Iterate through the first array and copy elements\nfor (int i = 0; i < arr1 . length ; i ++) {\nmerged [ index ] = arr1 [i];\nindex ++; // Move to the next spot\n}\n// Iterate through the second array and copy elements\nfor (int i = 0; i < arr2 . length ; i ++) {\nmerged [ index ] = arr2 [i];\nindex ++;\n}\nreturn merged ; // Return the fully merged array\n}\n```",
