                                "model_answer": "```java\npublic boolean areIdentical ( int [] a, int [] b) {\n// If lengths differ , they cannot be identical , return\nfalse immediately .\n// This also prevents IndexOutOfBoundsException in the\nloop .\nif (a. length != b. length ) {\nreturn false ;\n}\n// Since lengths are identical , iterate through index\nlimits\nfor (int i = 0; i < a. length ; i ++) {\n// Check element at exact same index in both arrays\nif (a[i] != b[i]) {\nreturn false ; // Mismatch found\n}\n}\nreturn true ; // Loop finished without mismatches\n}\n```",
