                                "model_answer": "```java\npublic int findSecondLargest ( int [] arr ) {\n// Initialize both to the smallest possible integer value\nint largest = Integer . MIN_VALUE ;\nint second = Integer . MIN_VALUE ;\nfor (int num : arr ) {\n// If we find a new absolute max :\nif ( num > largest ) {\n// The old max becomes the second max\nsecond = largest ;\n// Update the absolute max\nlargest = num ;\n}\n// If it 's smaller than max but larger than 'second '\nelse if ( num > second && num != largest ) {\nsecond = num ; // Update only the second max\n}\n}\nreturn second ;\n}\n```",
