                                "solutionCode": "public class Rational_number {\n    private int numerator;\n    private int denominator;\n\n    public Rational_number(int num, int den) {\n        this.numerator = num;\n        this.denominator = (den == 0) ? 1 : den;\n    }\n\n    public Rational_number addRational(Rational_number r) {\n        int newNum = (this.numerator * r.denominator) + (r.numerator * this.denominator);\n        int newDen = this.denominator * r.denominator;\n        return new Rational_number(newNum, newDen);\n    }\n\n    public Rational_number multRational(Rational_number r) {\n        return new Rational_number(this.numerator * r.numerator, this.denominator * r.denominator);\n    }\n}",
                                "model_answer": "```java\npublic class Rational_number {\n    private int numerator, denominator;\n    public Rational_number(int num, int den) { this.numerator = num; this.denominator = den; }\n    public Rational_number addRational(Rational_number r) {\n        return new Rational_number(this.numerator * r.denominator + r.numerator * this.denominator, this.denominator * r.denominator);\n    }\n}\n```",
